    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079660/extras/3450bc3b55b6fa2bc04272ea3ea8daf7.avif?t=1754991473\" width=620 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Twin-Stick Survivors</strong> you expand your base to capture skill tree nodes scattered around the map. You'll have to build turrets to defend your base against thousands of enemies flowing over the map. To handle their numbers, all your shots pierce enemies by default, so stacking damage won't be wasted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 upgrades of common, rare, epic or legendary quality on each map.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079660/extras/29de333a5cdbd4e3e7758369ed44fa29.poster.avif?t=1754991473\" width=620 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079660/extras/29de333a5cdbd4e3e7758369ed44fa29.webm?t=1754991473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079660/extras/29de333a5cdbd4e3e7758369ed44fa29.mp4?t=1754991473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend against 10,000+ enemies flowing over the map.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079660/extras/01c107dbb19be87b6faef4f8cd18e4de.poster.avif?t=1754991473\" width=620 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079660/extras/01c107dbb19be87b6faef4f8cd18e4de.webm?t=1754991473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079660/extras/01c107dbb19be87b6faef4f8cd18e4de.mp4?t=1754991473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy turrets to defend against incoming enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079660/extras/a2264d9a57e0c8b587d4aeafc4f8aa6b.poster.avif?t=1754991473\" width=620 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079660/extras/a2264d9a57e0c8b587d4aeafc4f8aa6b.webm?t=1754991473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079660/extras/a2264d9a57e0c8b587d4aeafc4f8aa6b.mp4?t=1754991473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shots pierce enemies to deliver maximum damage.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079660/extras/3450bc3b55b6fa2bc04272ea3ea8daf7.avif?t=1754991473\" width=620 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Twin-Stick Survivors</strong> you expand your base to capture skill tree nodes scattered around the map. You'll have to build turrets to defend your base against thousands of enemies flowing over the map. To handle their numbers, all your shots pierce enemies by default, so stacking damage won't be wasted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 upgrades of common, rare, epic or legendary quality on each map.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079660/extras/29de333a5cdbd4e3e7758369ed44fa29.poster.avif?t=1754991473\" width=620 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079660/extras/29de333a5cdbd4e3e7758369ed44fa29.webm?t=1754991473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079660/extras/29de333a5cdbd4e3e7758369ed44fa29.mp4?t=1754991473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend against 10,000+ enemies flowing over the map.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079660/extras/01c107dbb19be87b6faef4f8cd18e4de.poster.avif?t=1754991473\" width=620 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079660/extras/01c107dbb19be87b6faef4f8cd18e4de.webm?t=1754991473\" type=\"vi